WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.389
I'm Tallow.

00:00:01.889 --> 00:00:03.659
I work the night desk.

00:00:04.509 --> 00:00:08.790
My head is a candle,
and the wax is the time I have.

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:12.126
Every claim I check burns a little of it.

00:00:12.976 --> 00:00:15.680
So before I look,
I ask you what you think.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:18.438
Then we find the source together.

00:00:19.288 --> 00:00:21.637
Some claims hold up in the light.

00:00:22.137 --> 00:00:23.593
Some go blank.

00:00:24.093 --> 00:00:25.939
Either way, the call is yours.
